      "text": "NIKOLA TESLA SAID “IF YOU WANT TO FIND THE SECRETS OF THE UNIVERSE, THINK IN TERMS OF ENERGY, FREQUENCY AND VIBRATION.” HE WAS NOT SPEAKING PHILOSOPHICALLY. HE WAS GIVING YOU THE BLUEPRINT.\n\nWhen Tesla died on January 7th, 1943, the FBI raided his hotel room within hours. Not days. Hours. They seized 80 trunks of documents, prototypes, and research papers. All of it was immediately classified under the Office of Alien Property—despite Tesla being a US citizen.\n\nThe man they sent to review Tesla’s work was John G. Trump. Electrical engineer at MIT. Uncle of Donald Trump. He spent three days reviewing the seized materials and issued a public statement saying the work contained “nothing of significant value.”\n\n80 trunks. Decades of research from the most prolific inventor in human history. “Nothing of significant value.”\n\nThat was the official story. The classified reality is different.\n\nTesla’s seized documents included:\n\n— Wireless energy transmission. The ability to send healing frequencies to any point on Earth without wires, without towers, without infrastructure.\n\n— Resonant frequency medicine. Detailed protocols for using specific electromagnetic frequencies to destroy pathogens, regenerate tissue, and reverse aging.\n\n— Scalar wave technology. Energy waves that pass through all matter and interact directly with human cellular biology at the quantum level.\n\n— Anti-gravity propulsion. Which explains why the Office of Alien Property—not the Patent Office—seized his work.\n\nTesla did not just understand electricity. He understood that the human body IS electricity. That disease is a frequency problem. That aging is an energy problem. And that both can be solved with the correct application of resonant electromagnetic fields.\n\nEverything he built pointed toward one conclusion: a device that could restore the human body to perfect health using nothing but frequency. No chemicals. No surgery. No pharmaceutical intervention.\n\nHe des